In Terraform, the terraform.lock.hcl file is a lock file automatically generated when you run commands like terraform init. Here's what it does:
Purpose of terraform.lock.hcl:
Locks provider versions: Ensures everyone using the code gets the same provider versions.
Avoids unexpected changes: Prevents updates to provider plugins unless explicitly allowed (e.g., via terraform init -upgrade)..
Ensures reproducibility: Helps maintain consistent infrastructure across teams and environments.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
